/v1/","context":{"app_id":4656100,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4656100-1847286114040239","game_id":"steam-4656100","kind":"announcement","title":"Expanded Demo Out!","summary":"Greeting, the Expanded Demo is finally here!It adds an 1h to the total playtime of the demo and expands the single playthough time to 40-50 minutes! We also planned to add another scene originally (the first big romance one), but I'm having trouble with Terry's version of the scene so that one shall wait for the next bigger update.Includes:An alternate path in the beginning, where instead of Katsumi, you spend time with Terry. The adjustment to other scenes to acknowledge that.New CGs everywhere","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T17:32:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040239","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:35:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656100-1844751498219450","game_id":"steam-4656100","kind":"update","title":"Change Of Plans - Delayed Release & Small Update","summary":"Hi, we meet again!I'm sorry to say we made less progress than we expected since our last devlog.Partly because our parents surprised us with a last minute summer vacation (very welcome, but unexpected!), partly because right after we fell immediately sick (not so welcome, also unexpected!). We're fine now, but it took us a bit to recover.The extended demo release is being pushed back as it isn't ready to be published yet and with some coding issues taking me longer to fix than planned, we also r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T19:56:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656100-1841579228662918","game_id":"steam-4656100","kind":"announcement","title":"MC Sprite Added, New CGs, Controller Support","summary":"Did I say a week? Clearly, I was misinformed.Joking aside, the update took this long due to ever lengthening list of various fixes, changes and additions. When Katarina made MC sprites, I had to write the code for them in-game to test them, of course. I didn't have any other choice, clearly.Since I was in the middle of full GUI rework, this meant I couldn't just upload the new version with MC & new CGs. It had to wait.Then of course for every new or rework feature, several bugs spawned and so he","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T15:09:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656100-1836506165557264","game_id":"steam-4656100","kind":"update","title":"Release Date Announcement, MC Sprites & Progress Update","summary":"Greeting, darlings!Devlogs scare me.No, seriously, they terrify me. I'm normally an anxious, self-conscious mess so I overthink every single word I put out for you to see and it took me almost 4 hours to write this. Ridiculous, isn't it? That is why you get so little information on what we're doing. But I'll try to do better, so please be patient with me. For those of you interested just in a summary:Release date has been set to 29. October 2026.One reason is so we can apply to 2 different autum","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T21:12:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165557264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4656100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4656100":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4656100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4738700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4656100","app_id":4656100,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e5f162799886e8d17239970d559b68a640ca004bb1afa5682575bbd4fce541f6","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You're a witch who has just been evicted. Your only option for tonight? A haunted house full of fellow supernaturals. Find love and friendship in this supernatural amare VN with found family feels, 3 love interests and multiple endings.","publishers":[{"name":"Raven Myth Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":46122207}],"developers":[{"name":"Raven Myth Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":46122207}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"To Find A Home Official Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1785766710","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4656100/1923221067/2db206f469da54b7f8c03760d7b5210d0a388524/1785763570/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4656100/1923221067/2db206f469da54b7f8c03760d7b5